Usage: grid brain decide <task> <proposal-id> accept|reject|merge-into [<note-id>] [--note <reason>] [--link <json>]... [--json]
<task> is an id, exact folder name, or folder path inside a project tasks directory.
  -json
    	print JSON
  -link value
    	link JSON {to,rel,summary,why} added to the filed note (repeatable; ignored by reject)
  -note string
    	reason for the decision
